      <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
        <span class="text-3xl">✅</span>
        <div>
          <p class="text-lg font-bold text-green-900">Short Answer: 100% All-Beef</p>
          <p class="text-green-800 mt-1">The Costco hot dog contains <strong>zero pork</strong>. It is made exclusively with USDA Choice beef, water, salt, corn syrup solids, spices, and sodium-based preservatives. No poultry, no fillers, no mystery meat.</p>
