        <li><strong>Heme iron</strong> — More bioavailable than plant-based iron</li>
        <li><strong>Saturated fat</strong> — 13g per serving (65% DV) — a consideration for heart health</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">For the complete nutrition breakdown, see our <a href="/hot-dog/nutrition/" class="text-red-700 font-semibold hover:underline">nutrition facts page</a>.</p>
